Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 27 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyDown 33 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 33 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyDown 25 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 25 1
Delay 1 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Blade &amp; Soul</Software>
